  "components": [],
  "timeoriginalestimate": null,
  "description": {
   "type": "doc",
   "version": 1,
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "heading",
     "attrs": {
      "level": 3
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Description"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "When Sales By Customer or Sales By Representative is downloaded as a spreadsheet, the numbers arrive dressed up as text. Money comes out as $1,979.40 with a dollar sign and a comma, percentages as 100.0% with a percent sign, and dates as Jul 31 2026."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Because those cells hold text and not numbers, somebody opening the file in Excel cannot add them up, sort them or build a pivot table without cleaning every column first."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "heading",
     "attrs": {
      "level": 3
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Steps to reproduce"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Environment: QA branch sv8582 (https://sv8582.qa.shopview.com). Desktop browser, signed in as an Admin."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "orderedList",
     "attrs": {
      "order": 1
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "Open Reports, then Sales By Customer."
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "Set the date range to Last Month \u2014 1 to 31 July 2026 \u2014 and select the location Staging Heavy Duty - 9919."
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "Open the three-dot download menu and choose the summary spreadsheet download."
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "Open the downloaded file in a text editor or Excel and look at the money, percentage and date cells."
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "Repeat on Reports, then Sales By Representative. This was seen with customer Beman Systems, invoice S-15826 and sales representative Parth Fadadu; both the summary and the expanded downloads behave the same way on both reports."
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "heading",
     "attrs": {
      "level": 3
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Current behaviour"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Sales By Customer, summary download \u2014 one row, read straight from the file:"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "\"Beman Systems\",0.0,\"$1,979.40\",\"$1,979.40\",\"$2,459.48\",\"$2,459.48\",$207.84,\"$4,438.88\",95.5%,\"$4,646.72\""
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "The expanded download carries the date the same way: ,,P-126,\"Jul 31 2026\",0.0,$0.00,\u2026"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "It is not the date range \u2014 the same formatting appears at Last Month, Last Quarter and Last Year. It is not one report or one download: both reports and both downloads do it. On screen the money is correctly shown with dollar signs, which is what the screen is meant to do; the problem is only in the downloaded file."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "heading",
     "attrs": {
      "level": 3
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Expected behaviour"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "In the spreadsheets, money is a plain number with no dollar sign and no thousands separators, a percentage is a plain number with no percent sign, and a date is written mm-dd-yyyy."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "rule"
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Source",
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "strong"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": " \u2014 "
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "the "
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Sales By Customer report specification",
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "link",
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://shopview.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/~712020aa00b8d6a71f4259891982a304227c20/pages/577634305/SBC+Sales+By+Customer+Report"
         }
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": " on Confluence, version 15, requirement S14-R11: \u201cCurrency values export as plain numbers with no dollar sign and no thousands separators.\u201d"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "The same description, requirement S14-R9: \u201cThe Margin % cell is a plain number to one decimal with no percent sign (for example, 64.7); it is empty when the row's Subtotal is zero or below.\u201d"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "The same description, requirement S14-R10: \u201cDates export as mm-dd-yyyy \u2014 for example, 05-14-2026 \u2014 matching the ShopView-wide CSV date format.\u201d"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "The "
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Sales By Representative report specification",
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "link",
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://shopview.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/~712020aa00b8d6a71f4259891982a304227c20/pages/585629698/SBR+Sales+By+Representative+Report"
         }
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": " on Confluence, version 17, requirement S14-R17: \u201cCSV cell formatting (both CSVs): numeric columns are emitted as plain numbers for re-pivoting \u2014 no currency symbol, thousands separators, or parentheses; a negative value uses a leading minus (-1234.56).\u201d"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
